### Is it equivalent?

In the commute graph, flipping storm → alert to alert → storm keeps the skeleton and creates no v-structure, so the result is equivalent. Flipping roadwork → jam to jam → roadwork destroys the v-structure storm → jam ← roadwork, so it isn't. @fig-equivalence draws both.

